menu "I4A development"
    config I4A_FAST_TEST_TIMING
        bool "Use short telemetry and redundant discovery delays"
        default n
        help
            Laboratory only: redundant discovery waits 5 to 10 seconds,
            telemetry starts after 1 second and repeats every 5 seconds.
            Disable before deployment. Admission rules and turn leases
            remain unchanged.
endmenu
